How far will it continue?

00:22:36.330 --> 00:22:44.300
anata ni ageta hari no nai tokei wa

00:22:36.330 --> 00:22:44.300
I gave you a watch with no hands,

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:48.340
amai yume ga samenai you ni

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:48.340
